{"articleNo":"70339","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=70339&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 전부(과) 및 전공변경 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.22","hit":"6667","attachments":[{"name":"전부(과) 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70339&attachNo=2267"},{"name":"전공변경 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70339&attachNo=2269"},{"name":"2013학년도 전공 변경 신청 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70339&attachNo=2308"},{"name":"2013학년도 전부, 전과 신청 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70339&attachNo=2363"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\"><font color=\"#faecc5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;2013</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">학년도 전부(과) 및 전공변경 신청 안내 </span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2013</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">학년도 전부, 전과 및&nbsp;전공변경에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">안내하오니 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">희망하는 학생들은 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#662500\">1. 신청기간 :&nbsp;2012.12.04.(화)~12.07.(금)</font></span></strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong>2. 신청장소 : 전부(과)하고자 하는 해당 종합학사행정실</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">3.&nbsp;신청서류 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">전부(과) 신청서 또는 전공변경신청서 1부.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 신청 대상</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 2학년 재학생으로서 성적이 3.00 이상인 자</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 146.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -146.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직전 학기까지 취득학점이 70학점 이상인자, </span></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 146.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -146.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span><strong><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과는 75학점 이상인 자를 대상(2010학년도 이전 입학자 제외)</span></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 146.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -146.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong></strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[2012학년도 2학기 수강신청 학점 및 성적 포함]</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">※ 제외자 : 기 전부(과)자, 산업체 전형자, 편입생</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">※ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">야간 학생의 주간 학부(과) 전부는 해당 야간 학부(과)가 폐지된 이후 학년부터는 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 학년 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">제한 없이 신청 가능합니다.[추후 신청 접수 예정]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 허가인원 : 신청 안내문 안의 여석표 참조</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">6. 참고사항</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: null\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span>교직과정 이수 예정자가 전부(과) 및 전공변경할 경우&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">교직과정&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">선발이 취소됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;나. </span></span>전부(과) 확정 예정일 : 2013.01.21.(월)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 11. 22.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">교 무 처 장</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br></strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
